<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Santos 24-hour strike almost certain - union.</title>
<headline>Brazil Santos 24-hour strike almost certain - union.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 24-hour strike by administrative workers at Brazil's Santos port on October 18 is almost certain to go ahead despite an invitation to discuss grievances with the port authority, a union director said.</p>
<p>&quot;We have been invited to negotiate with the port authority on October 16 so already the threat of a strike has had some affect,&quot; said Bento Marques Prazeres.</p>
<p>&quot;But whatever happens tomorrow, the strike will almost certainly go ahead,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
